WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.566 --> 00:00:07.248
Here's your Crewflow dashboard. It brings
your staff, offers and shifts together, so

2
00:00:07.248 --> 00:00:09.755
you can see how the week's going at a
glance.

3
00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:15.201
The strip along the top shows how your
current offers are progressing: pending,

4
00:00:15.201 --> 00:00:17.179
accepted by staff, and confirmed.

5
00:00:17.699 --> 00:00:21.603
Beside it are your totals for staff, venue
managers and venues.

6
00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:26.442
Hours worked adds up the time your team
recorded over the last seven days.

7
00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:29.668
Hover over a day to see its exact total.

8
00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:35.231
Next to it, Shifts by venue counts the
last thirty days of shifts at your busiest

9
00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:35.640
venues.

10
00:00:36.466 --> 00:00:40.913
Shift readiness follows your next shift,
from staffing and attendance through to

11
00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:42.247
the finalised timesheet.

12
00:00:42.766 --> 00:00:46.339
Its checklist shows what's done, and what
still needs attention.

13
00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:51.780
Further down, the week view lists your
shifts day by day. Use the arrows to look

14
00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.876
ahead to next week.

15
00:00:53.699 --> 00:00:58.414
That's the dashboard. Select the arrow on
any card to open the page behind it.
